#org @gText_WelcomeToHOF
Welcome to the HALL OF FAME!\n Game Mode:

#org @gText_GlobalMart_Hi
Hi, there!\nMay I help you?

#org @gText_GlobalMart_Again
Please come again!
	
// VIRIDIAN CITY 

#org @gText_Viridian_ParcelThanks
Okay, thanks! Please say hi to\nProf. Oak for me, too.

#org @gText_Viridian_HiThere
Hi, there!\nMay I help you?

#org @gText_Viridian_PleaseAgain
Please come again!

// Rare Candy Guy
#org @gText_Want_RareCandy
Pssst! I have a great deal\nfor you!\pI can give you 100 Rare Candies\nfor just 5000 Poké Dollars!\pThey'd be great for raising\nPokémon on an adventure!\pDo you want 100 Rare Candies\nfor 5000 Poké Dollars?

#org @gText_Candy_Again
I'll be here if you want these\nRare Candies!

#org @gText_Not_Enough_Candy
That's not enough money!\nCome back when you have 5000.

#org @gText_Got_Candy
And remember this...\pYou didn't get those Rare Candies\nfrom me!

// Poke Vial Explain Guy
#org @gText_PokeVial_Explain
Press the R button, and press\n"Poké Vial" to restore all of\pyour Pokémon.\pIt's very handy out in the field\nbut you only have 6 charges\pbefore you need to take it\nto a Pokémon Center and\precharge it.

//Wide Lens Guy
#org @gText_Here_Wide_Lens
Yawn!\nI must have dozed off in the sun.\pI had this weird dream about\na Hypno eating my dream.\pI'm spooked!\nHere, have this.

#org @gText_Thats_WideLens
Wide Lens make the holder's\nmoves more accurate.

// Giovanni Gym

#org @gText_Giovanni_Intro
Fwahahaha!\pSurprised to see me, young\nprodigy?\pYes, not only am I the leader\nof Team Rocket, I'm also the\pViridian City Gym Leader.\pLet's see how good you really\nare.\pFace me, Giovanni, the greatest\nTrainer in the world!

#org @gText_Giovanni_Lost
Ha!\nThat was a truly intense fight.\nYou have won!

#org @gText_Giovanni_PostBattle
As proof of your victory, take\nthis Earth Badge.

#org @gText_Got_EarthBadge
[PLAYER] recieved the Earth Badge from\nGiovanni.

#org @gText_Here_Earthquake
It is evidence of your mastery\nas a Pokémon Trainer. With it,\pyou can challenge the Pokémon\nLeague.\pAlso take this TM.

#org @gText_Thats_Earthquake
We will meet again, young\nprodigy.\pWhat's that?\pDisband Team Rocket?\pFwahahaha!\pWho do you think you are,\nkid?

// #ROUTE 2

// Tera Orb Aide 
#org @gText_HereIsTera
Hello [PLAYER]!\pI work with Prof. Oak, based\nin Pewter City. He called me\pand told me to give you\nthis. 

#org @gGot_Tera_Orb
You recieved a Tera Orb!

#org @gThats_Tera
That Tera Orb will allow you\nto Terastallize one of your Pokémon\pin battle. It should help you\nwith your Gym challenge.\pPress the R Button when selecting\na move to Terastallize.\pGood luck and see you soon,\n[PLAYER]!  

// Eastern Building Aide
#org @gText_Aide_East
Hi! Remember me?\nI'm one of Prof. Oak's Aides.\pProf. Oak entrusted me with this\nHM, Fly, to give to you.

#org @gText_Thats_UTurn
U-Turn is a Bug-type attack\nthat also switches out the Trainer's\pPokémon on hit.\pIt's very popular amongst some of\nthe best Trainers in the world. 

#org @gText_Thats_Fly
Have a Pokémon that can use\nFly to take you back to\pplaces that you've already visited.\pYou'll need it to navigate\nKanto.
// #PEWTER

//Pewter Aide
#org @gPewter_Aide
Hello again [PLAYER]!\pHow are you finding that Tera\nOrb?\pI've heard a rumor that there\nis someone in the region with\pknowledge of how to change a\nPokémon's Tera-Type. It would be\pa great help to you if\nyou can find that person.

//Old Man in Museum
#org @gOldMan_Sitrus
I should be grateful for my long\nlife.\pNever did I think I would get to\nsee the bones of a dragon!\pIt's making me feel generous.\nTake this.

#org @gThats_Sitrus
That's a Sitrus Berry. It\nrestores your Pokémon's HP when\pthey're low. Use it well.

#org @gOldMan_Museum
This is wonderful!

// Pikachu Father Giorgio in Museum 
#org @gText_Pikachu_Father
My daughter wants a Pikachu of her\nown but they're not exactly easy\pto catch.\pYou have the look of a\nTrainer.\pDo you want to battle against my\nPikachu?

#org @gText_Giorgio_NoBattle
You must be busy, I understand.

#org @gText_Giorgio_Battle
Let's do it!

#org @gText_Giorgio_PostBattle
Great, my daughter's crying again.

#org @gText_Giorgio_Outro
Our Pokemon did well not to\ndamage anything in here.

//Fossil Regen in Museum
#org @gText_Fossil_Regen
We have two fossils of rare,\nprehistoric Pokémon on exhibit.\pWe can actually restore fossils here\nif you have them.

#org @gText_WantToReviveDome
Do you want to revive this\nDome Fossil?

#org @gText_WantToReviveHelix
Do you want to revive this\nHelix Fossil?

#org @gText_WantToReviveJaw
Do you want to revive this\nJaw Fossil?

#org @gText_WantToReviveSail
Do you want to revive this\nSail Fossil?

#org @gText_Exit
Exit 

#org @gText_Got_Kabuto
[PLAYER] recieved the Kabuto\nfrom the doctor.

#org @gText_Got_Omanyte
[PLAYER] recieved the Omanyte\nfrom the doctor.

#org @gText_Got_Tyrunt
[PLAYER] recieved the Tyrunt\nfrom the doctor.

#org @gText_Got_Amaura
[PLAYER] recieved the Amaura\nfrom the doctor.

#org @gText_Fossil_ComeBack
Come back if you want to\nrevive a fossil.

//# ROUTE 3
#org @gText_Trainer_Robin
Eek!\nDid you touch me?

#org @gText_Robin_Lost
That's it?

#org @gText_Robin_PostBattle
Oh well.\nHere, take this TM.

#org @gText_Thats_ShockWave
Shock Wave is an Electric-Type\nattack that never misses.\pTeach it to a Pikachu!

#org @gText_Robin_Idle
Route 4 is at the foot of\nMt. Moon.

// ##MT.MOON
// Fossil Excavator 
#org @gText_Excavator
Hi, I'm excavating for fossils here\nunder Mt. Moon.\pSometimes Brock of Pewter Gym\nlends me a hand.\pAs it so happens, I have\ntwo fossils here that I obtained\pfrom the Kalos region.\pI'm tired of carrying the both of\nthem so would you care to\ptake one of them off my\nhands please?

#org @gText_Jaw_Fossil
Jaw Fossil

#org @gText_Sail_Fossil
Sail Fossil

#org @gText_Neither 
Neither

#org @gThats_JawSailFossil
Now, as for how to resurrect\nfrom this fossil, I have no idea.

#org @gText_Excavator_Neither
Fair enough.\nI'll be here if you want\pa fossil.\pAnd I'd be very grateful if you'd\ntake one.

//Nurse Mt. Moon
#org @gText_Nurse_MtMoon
Mt. Moon is a trek!\nLet me heal you're Pokemon.

#org @gText_Nurse_Done
There, good as new!\pUnfortunately I can't recharge\nyour Poké Vial. You'll need\pto do that at a Pokémon\nCenter.

// ##ROUTE 4 WEST CERULEAN

//Mega Move Guy
#org @gText_BulkUp_Guy
A punch of roaring ferocity!\pPacked with destructive power!\pThat's what happens after you use\nBulk Up!\pYes! Bulk Up!\pHere, take it!

#org @gText_Thats_BulkUp
Bulk Up raises your Pokémon's Attack\nand Defense.\pNow we are comrades in the\nway of Bulk Up!

//Mega Kick Guy
#org @gText_MegaKick
Mega Kick? Mega Punch?\pNever heard of 'em.

// #CERULEAN

//Badge Checker Guy
#org @gText_Badge_Guy
Only skilled Trainers can collect\nPokémon Badges.\pI see you have at least one.\pThose Badges have amazing secrets,\ndid you know?

#org @gText_Rival_Cerulean_Intro
[RIVAL]: Yo! [PLAYER]! You're still\nstruggling along back here? I'm\pdoing great! I caught a bunch\nof strong and smart Pokémon!

#org @gRival_Cerulean_Battle
Here, let me see what you've\ncaught, [PLAYER]!

#org @gText_Rival_Cerulean_PostBattle
Hey!\nTake it easy!\pYou won already!

#org @gText_Rival_Cerulean_Outro
[RIVAL]: Hey, guess what?\nI went to Bill's and got \phim to show me his rare\nPokémon. That added a lot of\ppages to my Pokédex! After\nall, Bill's world famous as\pa Pokémaniac. He invented the\nPokémon Storage System on PC too.\pSince you're using his system, you\nshould go thank him. Well, I\pbetter get rolling! Smell ya later!

// ##ROUTE 24 NORTH CERULEAN

// Nugget Grunt
#org @gText_Congrats_Nugget
Congratulations! You beat our\nfive contest Trainers!\pYou just earned a fabulous prize!

#org @gText_Join_Rocket
By the way, how would you like to\njoin Team Rocket?\pWe're a group of professional\ncriminals specializing in Pokémon!\pWant to join?

#org @gText_Please_Join
Are you sure?\pCome on, join us!\pI'm telling you to join!\pOkay, you need convincing!\pI'll make you an offer you can't\nrefuse!

#org @gText_Nugget_PostBattle
Arrgh!\nYou are good!

#org @gText_Nugget_Beaten
With your ability, you'd become\na top leader in Team Rocket.\pCome on, think of the opportunity!\nDon't let this chance go to waste.

#org @gText_Report_Rocket
Okay, report to our base at the\nCeladon Game Corner.\pIf anyone asks, tell 'em\nthat the Nugget Bridge Grunt\psent you.

// ##ROUTE 25 EAST NUGGET BRIDGE 

#org @gText_Trainer_Haley
My friend has many cute Pokémon.\nI'm so jealous.

#org @gText_Haley_Lost
I'm not so jealous!

#org @gText_Haley_PostBattle
I need cuter Pokémon. Here, take\nthis.

#org @gText_Thats_GigaDrain
I love Giga Drain! It does\ndamage and also restores your\pPokémon's HP.\pWorks great against Misty!

#org @gText_Haley_Idle
You came from Mt. Moon?\pMay I have a Clefairy?

// ROUTE 5 SOUTH CERULEAN

//Day Care Lady
#org @gText_Want_Egg
My husband recently came across\nthis Pokémon Egg on his travels.\pI think it needs a strong trainer\nto raise it properly.\pWould you be willing to bring\nit with you?

#org @gText_Egg_Again
I'll be here if you change\nyour mind.

#org @gText_Got_Egg
[PLAYER] recieved an Egg from the\nlady!

#org @gText_Care_Egg
Please take care of that Egg!\nIt will require a kind trainer\pto look after it.

// ##DIGLETT CAVE 

#org @gText_Trainer_Wes
I've caught some great Diglett\nin here.\pTime to test them out!

#org @gText_Wes_Lost
Nooo my Diglett!

#org @gText_Wes_PostBattle
Thanks for battling my Diglett.\pI have these spare Heavy-Duty Boots\nthat you might be able to\pput to good use.

#org @gText_Thats_Boots
Those Heavy-Duty Boots will protect\na Pokémon from entry hazard moves\psuch as Stealth Rock.

// ROUTE 10 BEFORE ROCK TUNNEL 

//Route 10 Aide
#org @gText_Route10_Aide
Oh. [PLAYER]!\pI've been looking for you!\pIt's me! One of the ever-present\nAides to Prof. Oak.\pHe entrusted me with this\nEverstone to give to you, [PLAYER].

#org @gText_Thats_Everstone
Making Pokémon evolve certainly\ncan add to the Pokédex.\pHowever, at times, you may not\nwant a certain Pokémon to evolve.\pIn that case, give the Everstone\nto that Pokémon.\pIt will prevent evolution according\nto the Professor.

// ROUTE 11 SOUTH gText_Lavender

//Route 11 Aide
#org @gText_Route11_Aide
Hi! Remember me?\pI'm one of Prof. Oak's Aides.\pProf. Oak entrusted me with the\nItemfinder for you.

#org @gText_Thats_Itemfinder
There are items on the ground that\nmay be hidden from view.\pUse the Itemfinder to detect any\nhidden items close to you.\pThe machine is a bit limited.\nIt can't pinpoint item locations.\pWhat it does is show the direction\nwhere the item is.\pUse it to get your bearings, then\nsearch the suspect area by hand.

// ROUTE 7 EAST CELADON 

//Black Augurite Trainer 
#org @gText_Trainer_Kenny
You there! Beat me in a\nbattle and i'll give you something.

#org @gText_Kenny_Lost
Well fought, young man.

#org @gText_Kenny_PostBattle
You won fair and square.\pHave this.

#org @gText_Thats_Augurite
I found that augurite when i\nwas in the Sinnoh region.\pI'm not sure what it does\nbut it looks important.\pMaybe you can find a use\nfor it.

// CELADON CITY

//Rocket Hideout
//Petrel
#org @gText_MeetPetrel
How did you get in here?\pThis place is off-limits.\nRun along now, child.\p...\p......\pHave it your way then.

#org @gText_Petrel_PostBattle
Petrel: What?!

#org @gText_Petrel_Idle
Petrel: Giovanni forgive me..\pOhh what do I do?!

#org @gText_MeetArcher
Whoa! What are you doing in\nhere?\pLeave at once!

#org @gText_Archer_PostBattle
Archer: I don't believe this!

#org @gText_Archer_Idle
Archer: You're quite the Trainer.\pYou still need to get out of\nhere though.\pThis is no place for kids.

#org @gText_MeetAriana
Hold it right there!\pWe can't have a little brat\nlike you on the loose!

#org @gText_Ariana_PostBattle
Ariana: Tch!

#org @gText_Ariana_Idle
Ariana: You're strong.\pWhy are you even in here\nanyway?!

//Giovanni
#org @gText_Giovanni
Who are you?\pI'm very impressed that you've made\nit past my employees, you must\pbe quite the little prodigy.\pI am Giovanni.\pYou should join us. We could\nuse the extra firepower.\pI can make you very rich.\nYou'll be set for life!\pFwahahaha!\pNow, I must take my leave. I\nhave business to attend to.\pThink about it, young prodigy.

// Oak After Gym
#org @gText_MegaRing
Well done [PLAYER]!\pI was watching your battle through\nthe window there.\pYou're becoming quite the young\nTrainer.\pI came all this way to give you\nsomething.\pI'm sure you've seen Trainers on\nTV using Mega-Evolved Pokémon,\pPokémon that have taken on a\ngreater form during battle.\pWell, with this Mega Ring, you'll\nbe able to Mega Evolve your\pown Pokémon too.

#org @gText_Thats_MegaRing
You'll need more than just the\nMega Ring to Mega Evolve your\pPokémon though.\pYou'll also require Mega Stones.

#org @gText_Charizardite
This is for the Pokémon that\nyou recieved in my Lab.\pHave it hold one of these,\nthen use your Mega Ring in battle\pby pressing the R Button when\nselecting a move.\pCharizard has two possible Mega\nEvolutions, depending on which of\pthese stones that it's holding.\pBoth forms are quite different so\nmaybe test each one in battle\pand see which one you prefer.

#org @gText_Blastoisinite
This is for the Pokémon that\nyou recieved in my Lab.\pHave it hold this stone, then\nuse your Mega Ring in battle\pby pressing the R Button when\nselecting a move.

#org @gText_Bye_Oak
I'm sure you'll find more Mega\nStones as you travel.\pI've kept you long enough.\pI must return to my Lab.\pTalk soon, [PLAYER]!

// SAFFRON CITY

//Silph Co.
//Petrel 2
#org @gText_Petrel_Oak
Prof. Oak: Hellooo!\pWhat are you doing in Silph\nCo?\pYou should really leave, there's\nnothing here anyway.\pDon't you have a Pokémon League\nChallenge to be doing?!\pFwahahaha!

#org @gText_Petrel_Stop
Prof. Oak: Damn it!\pYou should've listened\nto me!

#org @gText_Petrel_Disguise
Petrel: Either my disguise didn't\nfool you or you're just a\pdisobedient infant.\pNow I'm going to make an\nexample of you.

#org @gText_Petrel_Lost2
Petrel: Noooo!

#org @gText_Petrel_PostBattle2
Petrel: Giovanni forgive me, I\nwill make this up to you!

//Giovanni Scene Silph 
#org @gText_Giovanni_Silph
Giovanni: Ah! The young prodigy!\pThe President and I were just\ndiscussing a vital business\pproposition.\pI assume you've come to take\nme up on my offer and\pjoin Team Rocket?\pNo?\pI must say, I'm dissapointed.\pArcher, Ariana, take care of this!\pArcher & Ariana: Yes Boss!

#org @gText_Archer_PreBattle
Archer: You won't beat the two\nof us together!

#org @gText_Ariana_PreBattle
Ariana: Stay out of our way,\nbrat!

#org @gText_Silph_Double_Loss
Archer: Man, you're strong.\pAriana: I.. I'm shattered.

#org @gText_Archie_Loss
Archer: We'll meet again kid.

#org @gText_Ariana_Loss
Ariana: Ta-ta for now, brat!

//Woman in Pokemon Center
#org @gText_Cant_TeraEvolve
You can't Terastallize one Pokémon\nand then Mega Evolve another\pin the same battle.\pYou can't have it both ways!

// ROUTE 16 WEST CELADON

//Aide in builidng 
#org @gText_Aide_Route16
Hi! Remember me?\nI'm one of Prof. Oak's Aides.\pProf. Oak entrusted me with this\nTM43, Tera Blast for you.

#org @gText_Thats_Terablast
If your Pokémon has Terastallized,\nit attacks using its Tera-\pType.\pThis move inflicts damage using\nthe Attack or Sp. Atk, whichever\pis higher for the user.\pThis could be a game-changer\nfor you.\pUse it well.

//Woman behind Aide Building
#org @gText_Amulet_Woman
Oh, dear.\nYou've found my secret retreat.\pPlease don't tell anyone I'm here.\pI'll make it up to you with this!

#org @gText_Thats_AmuletCoin
Have one of your Pokémon hold\nthat before it battles and\pit will double your winnings!\p...\pNo, it's perfectly legal!

//ROUTE 18 WEST FUCHSIA

//Ramiro
#org @gText_Ramiro_Intro
Kurukkoo!\nHow do you like my birdcall?

#org @gText_Ramiro_PostBattle
I had to bug you!

#org @gText_Here_Pidgeotite
Here, I have this spare\nPidgeotite. You deserve it.

#org @gText_Thats_Pidgeotite
Use it to Mega Evolve a\nPidgeot.\pMega Pidgeot's moves don't miss!

// ROUTE 14 EAST FUCHSIA

// Yazmin 
#org @gText_Yazmin_Intro
Want to play with my Pokémon?

#org @gText_Yazmin_Loss
I was too impatient!

#org @gText_Here_Beedrillite
You have a Mega Ring, take\nthis Beedrillite!

#org @gText_Thats_Beedrillite
Mega Beedrill is super strong\nand fast.\pI don't know how you beat\nit!

// ROUTE 15 GATE TO FUCHSIA

#org @gText_Route15_Aide
Hi! Remember me?\nI'm one of Prof. Oak's Aides.\pFor some reason, Prof. Oak\nhas instructed me to give you\pthis.

#org @gText_Thats_ToxicOrb
According to Prof. Oak, that\nToxic Orb can actually be used to\pmake certain Pokémon more effective\nin battle, despite it badly\ppoisoning them if they hold it.\pI don't get it, but Prof.\nOak says it works and who am\pI to argue? 

// ROUTE 19 SOUTH FUCHSIA

// Axle
#org @gText_Axle_Intro
Ahoy there!\nThese waters are treacherous!

#org @gText_Axle_PostBattle
Ooh!\nDangerous!

#org @gText_Here_Gyaradosite
M-my legs! They cramped up!\nGlub, glub.\pTake this, glub, glub, before\nI drown!

#org @gText_Thats_Gyaradosite
Use that, glub, glub, to Mega-\nEvolve, glub, glub, Gyarados!

// CINNABAR

// Cinnabar Lab
// Dubious Disc Guy
#org @gText_Here_Dubious 
Tch-tch-tch!\nI'll give you a nifty item.\pGive it to a Porygon2, and watch\nthe fun unfold!

#org @gText_Thats_Dubious
Thats a Dubious Disc.\nIt further enhances the evolution\pof Porygon.

//Fossil Regenerator
#org @gText_Aerodactyl_Regen
Hiya!\pI am important doctor.\nYes, very much so, indeed.\pHere, I study rare Pokémon fossils.\nAll the time, I study.\pYou!\nHave you a fossil for me?

#org @gText_Amber_ComeBack
Aiyah!\nYou come again!

#org @gText_WantToReviveAmber
You want to revive this Old Amber?

#org @gText_Got_Aerodactyl
[PLAYER] recieved the Aerodactyl\nfrom the doctor.

// TWO ISLAND

// Move Reminder Guy
#org @gText_No_Need
I'm the Pokémon Move Maniac.\pI know every single move that\nPokémon learn growing up.\pOh!\pI guess you have no need\nof me.

#org @gText_RareMoves_Hi
I have rare TMs. Would\nyou like to purchase some?

// VICTORY ROAD  

// Juggler Nelson 
#org @gText_Nelson_Intro
Ah, so you wish to\nchallenge the Elite Four?

#org @gText_Nelson_Loss
You got me!

#org @gText_Here_Aerodactylite
Some brash guy came through\nhere earlier.\pHe was really tough.\pThis might help you beat him.

#org @gText_Thats_Aerodactylite
Use the Aerodactylite to Mega-\nEvolve an Aerodactyl.\pNot many Pokémon hit harder than\nMega Aerodactyl.

#org @gText_Nurse_Victory
There's a lot of tough trainers\nhere.\pLet me heal your Pokémon!

// Whitney
#org @gText_Whitney_Intro
Snivel, hic..\pI was a member of the Elite\nFour, but some guy just came\pin and beat me!\pSnivel, hic..\pAfter I beat you, I'm\ngonna go back and beat\peverybody!

#org @gText_Whitney_Loss
Snivel, hic... you meanie!

#org @gText_Whitney_Idle
Sob...Waaaaaaaah!